      "cooked": "<p>Greetings! GTG is once again attending PAX East this year in Boston, MA, which runs from 11 April - 13 April, and we are looking for booth volunteers!</p><p><strong><span>What You Would Do:</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span>Run demo games.</span></li>\n<li><span>Talk to people about our game.</span></li>\n<li><span>Spend 50% of the Expo Hall hours (which run 8-6 all three days) in the booth helping out.</span></li>\n</ul><p><strong>What You Would Get:</strong></p><ul>\n<li><span>A Free Exhibitor Badge to this sold out show!</span></li>\n<li><span>Two Free Tshirts</span></li>\n<li><span>Free Dinner &amp; Drinks Thurs. or Fri. evening with GTG and all of the volunteers.</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you are interested, or have any questions, please email me at paul@greaterthangames.com!</p>",
